# User Story 13 and 14 – Customer Profile & Personalisation

## Story 13: View Customer Profile

**Priority:** Medium  
**Estimate:** 3 Ideal Days  

### Description
As a customer,  
I want to view my profile information and account settings,  
So that I can manage my account details and quickly access personal options.

### Acceptance Criteria
- Customer profile card displayed in settings
- Username/avatar visible
- Easy access to saved stores
- Easy access to order history
- Navigation available from settings page

### Business Value
Improves user convenience and strengthens account engagement.

## Story 14: Change Theme & Accent

**Priority:** Medium  
**Estimate:** 2 Ideal Days  

### Description
As a customer,  
I want to customise the app theme and accent colours,  
So that I can personalise the app experience.

### Acceptance Criteria
- Dark mode toggle available
- Accent colour options available
- Theme changes instantly
- Reset settings button available
- Preference retained during session

### Business Value
Improves user satisfaction and app personalisation.
